              "content": "{A挠头}探险杂志的主编寄来了这期的样刊，\n说让我看看有没有哪里写得不对……",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_21010130073_2334347230_content",
