                "textId": "Performance_21010130073_3029094670_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "其实，{A害羞挠头}我在采访时还提到了，\n和<style=PlayerName>{玩家昵称}</style>你一起的新探险。\n可惜这次没放进文章里……",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_21010130073_3029094670_content",
                "value": "其实，{A害羞挠头}我在采访时还提到了，\n和<style=PlayerName>{玩家昵称}</style>你一起的新探险。\n可惜这次没放进文章里……",
                "duration": null,
